WEBVTT

NOTE Narration is displayed in the caption strip below the video by default.

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.262
Check the fictional retained plan from all three perspectives.

00:00:04.262 --> 00:00:09.945
The worker can find the task, practical support and coordinator question route.

00:00:09.945 --> 00:00:13.733
The recipient’s accuracy and privacy needs remain visible.

00:00:13.733 --> 00:00:17.522
The reviewer keeps checking, correction and stop duties.

00:00:17.522 --> 00:00:23.678
The policy owner handles access concerns, and the manager owns the pilot decision.

00:00:23.678 --> 00:00:29.361
The affected pilot remains paused until appropriate human review verifies the conditions.

00:00:29.361 --> 00:00:36.465
Save the final Leadership and Adoption Plan, communication and training resource with the revision rationale.

00:00:36.465 --> 00:00:41.674
Final means the journey’s retained version, not permission for wider adoption.

00:00:41.674 --> 00:00:45.463
Keep earlier evidence, balanced measures and unresolved dependencies.

00:00:45.463 --> 00:00:53.513
In your applied check, defend proceed, limited test, revise or pause using actual evidence and permission limits.

00:00:53.513 --> 00:00:56.828
Carry this same project into Journey Four.

00:00:56.828 --> 00:01:02.511
A successful rehearsal can demonstrate reasoning; it cannot establish actual staff acceptance.
